  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Season the cod fillet with salt and pepper. ",
    "In a bowl, mix together the flour, breadcrumbs, garlic, and parsley.",
    "Add the egg to the bowl and mix until a dough forms. ",
    "Wrap each cod fillet in the dough, making sure to seal the edges. ",
    "Place the dumplings on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. ",
    "Drizzle with olive oil and bake for 15 minutes, or until golden brown."
